{"id":"fa249af3230be7c7","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded.md","title":"thm-multiset-extension-well-founded","display":"thm-multiset-extension-well-founded","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded","aliases":["56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded"],"display":"thm-multiset-extension-well-founded","type":"theorem","depends_on":["[[56-df-multiset-extension]]","[[56-df-reduction-order]]","[[56-df-well-founded]]"],"source_section":"A.6.2–A.6.5","source_pages":"821–823","source_ocr_blocks":[842,843,844],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-multiset-extension-well-founded"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c18125c091d1dde\" href=\"?note=2c18125c091d1dde\" title=\"56-df-well-founded\">56-df-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"A.6.2–A.6.5"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"821–823"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>842</span><span>843</span><span>844</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\\subseteq A^2\">\\(&gt;\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,&gt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,&gt;)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_f(A)\">\\(\\mathcal M_f(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\">\\(&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 沿关系的下降方向解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(A,&gt;)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(\\mathcal M_f(A),&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(\\mathcal M_f(A),&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(A,&gt;)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(\\mathcal M_f(A),&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(\\mathcal M_f(A),&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem A.6.5。每次替换把被删元素作为树节点，把替入的有限多个较小元素作为子节点，删除则加终止标记。无限多重集下降将产生无限有限分支树；König 引理给出无限路径，从而给出 A 中无限 &gt; 下降链。严格序性由 A.6.2–A.6.3 的公共部分消去刻画保证。已读原书 pp.822–823 的证明；多重集的有限性不可删去。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；A.6.2–A.6.5，印刷页 821–823。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-multiset-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"2c18125c091d1dde","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A$ 为集合，$>\\subseteq A^2$，$\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,>)$；$\\mathcal M_f(A)$、$>^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 见 [[56-df-multiset-extension]]，$\\mathrm{WF}$ 沿关系的下降方向解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":">\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,>)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_f(A)","display":false},{"tex":">^{\\mathrm{mul}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(A,>)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(\\mathcal M_f(A),>^{\\mathrm{mul}})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(\\mathcal M_f(A),>^{\\mathrm{mul}}).","display":true}],"bytes":1593,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded.md]]"},{"id":"298ee1b282da57bf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数 $>$ 的有限多重集良基性见 [[56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded]]；工作于ZFC。"}],"outgoing":["943afdb3e6462a3a","ea6d0d000271b1cf","2c18125c091d1dde"]}